  "source": "[\\binary.operation:on{X}]\nDeclares: x_ * y_ is \\function:on{X \\.set.cross./ X}:to{X}\nwhen: X is \\set\nDocumented:\n. called: \"binary operation on $X?$\"\n. description: \"A binary operation on $X$ takes two elements of $X$ and returns\n                an element of $X$. Formally it is a function from $X \\times X$\n                to $X$, written in infix form as $x * y$.\"\nId: \"82c8948a-c30d-464b-8ab0-1c7bdb2ed770\"",
